  "contract": [
    "Only LiA and the listed map/script pairs are adapted, and only when paired original casts or trap bodies match structurally.",
    "Extra living, visible, controlled heroes/script-controlled characters join effects after the first two story records. Dead/hidden/disconnected extras and pets without hero/script control are excluded. Guest-owned Kel is already covered and is not repeated.",
