    "Party spell source/target coordinates are rebound where the source script uses each hero position. Fixed lever origins stay fixed.",
    "Existing condition/block/statement indexes do not move. A cast statement is replaced in place, and a trap block is appended. Original sleeping saves continue without replaying prior casts."
